h3-connect-your-app-to-singular-pc25eb33.translation:
```typescript showLineNumbers
import { adapty } from 'react-native-adapty';
import { Singular, SingularConfig } from 'singular-react-native';

const config = new SingularConfig('<SINGULAR_SDK_KEY>', '<SINGULAR_SDK_SECRET>')
  // null keeps the SDID that Singular generates. Singular's typings require a string.
  .withCustomSdid(null as unknown as string, () => {}, async (sdid) => {
    try {
      await adapty.setIntegrationIdentifier('singular_sdid', sdid);
      // Call adapty.identify() here, if your app identifies users
    } catch (error) {
      // handle `AdaptyError`
    }
  });

Singular.init(config);
```

h3-connect-your-app-to-singular-p61b0e61.translation:
